Today (and with this transfer) I've had quite a bit to think about and it's
been busy and in the end I didn't really get a chance to write an email.
Sorry =F0=9F=98=85 I will try and make even this short email meaningful tho=
ugh!

Here's a few fun things you'll get to hear about next week!

I got a bean! Meaning I'm going to be training a new missionary! =F0=9F=98=
=B2

I lost a lot of stuff =F0=9F=98=85 just not my temper =F0=9F=98=8E=E2=9C=8C=
=EF=B8=8F

We have up to 5 new people coming to our Eikaiwa this next week =F0=9F=8E=
=89=F0=9F=8E=89

We were able to meet up with some people at a community center and play
Magic the Gathering =F0=9F=94=A5=F0=9F=94=A5

That's a few of them!

Last message:
Don't be upset over things out of your control, or try not to be upset over
them. There are a lot of things that we really don't have too much
influence over, even if we are trying our hardest to influence them. If you
feel like you are giving your 100% and it's not enough please don't worry
too much about it! God loves effort. He loves you!

I love you too!

I'll write more next week!

